    "limits": "UI drawing and physical input are not executed. The two capability/metadata queries are supplied as booleans; their firmware predicates and real availability are not established. Original UI toggle, commit segment, guarded exporter, tag getter and mode5 producer run as separate segments. Export cases independently seed the UI config value. The four-job segment first receives a seeded expansion flag; separate RAW cases derive it from original input-kind and tag branches with an intercepted allocator. Complete RAW jobs and metadata validity are untested."
