  "limits": [
    "The mode preparation prefix stops before unrelated virtual initialization methods. The second-pass producer, mask producer and module20 completion handler then run as separate original functions without hooks on synthetic state.",
    "Mode 5 is tied to a real DevelopmentRawImage call site and a separate Normal DevMode diagnostic path. Numeric job modes are not exposure-dial labels.",
    "The standalone mask cases seed layout kind and capture enum. Separate RAW expansion cases execute the four-job kind producer with an intercepted allocator. Their physical camera menu producers and all permitted combinations remain unresolved.",
    "The module20 completion handler establishes state transitions; these probes do not execute the device, upstream eligibility or complete asynchronous recipe."
  ]
